{%- comment -%}
  The next Bush Ride, in four places: the desktop rail foot, the home page
  card, the mobile menu sheet and the foot of the journal.

  Empty on arrival and filled by alpine.js from the routes worker's public
  /events feed, so nobody has to remember to update a date before a ride.
  Until that resolves — and if it never does — the block stays `hidden` and
  the page reads as though it was never there.

  Deep link: the map selects by hash only for ROUTES (map.js selectFromHash),
  so an event reaches the map through its own route_id when it has one; the
  events index is the fallback. Both are resolved in JS, where the event data
  lives.

  Accepts:
    variant - 'rail' | 'card' | 'panel'
    heading - eyebrow text, default 'Next ride'
    note    - optional right-hand eyebrow (card only), e.g. "Free · all welcome"
    cta     - link label, default 'View on BUSH MAP™ →'
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign nr_variant = variant | default: 'card'
  assign nr_heading = heading | default: 'Next ride'
  assign nr_cta = cta | default: 'View on BUSH MAP™ →'
-%}

{%- case nr_variant -%}
  {%- when 'rail' -%}
    <div class="alp-nr alp-nr--rail" data-alp-next-ride hidden>
      <span class="alp-nr__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="alp-nr__date">{{ nr_heading | escape }}<br><span data-nr-date></span></p>
      <p class="alp-nr__place"><span data-nr-place></span><br><span data-nr-note></span></p>
      <a class="alp-nr__link" href="#" data-nr-link>Join the ride <span class="alp-glyph">✦</span></a>
    </div>

  {%- when 'panel' -%}
    <a class="alp-nr alp-nr--panel" href="#" data-alp-next-ride data-nr-link hidden>
      <span class="alp-nr__tab">{{ nr_heading | escape }}</span>
      <span class="alp-nr__date"><span data-nr-date></span><br><span data-nr-place></span></span>
      <span class="alp-chip alp-nr__cta">{{ nr_cta | escape }}</span>
    </a>

  {%- else -%}
    <a class="alp-nr alp-nr--card" href="#" data-alp-next-ride data-nr-link hidden>
      <span class="alp-nr__head">
        <span class="alp-nr__eyebrow">{{ nr_heading | escape }}</span>
        {%- if note != blank -%}<span class="alp-nr__eyebrow">{{ note | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      </span>
      <span class="alp-nr__date"><span data-nr-date></span> — <span data-nr-place></span></span>
      <span class="alp-nr__note" data-nr-note></span>
      <span class="alp-chip alp-nr__cta">{{ nr_cta | escape }}</span>
    </a>
{%- endcase -%}
